{
  "episode": "EP08",
  "voice_id": "ojz6ro9PB1xDu44lymdM",
  "narration_seconds": 64.105,
  "files": [
    {
      "file": "00_hook.mp3",
      "text": "Kenapa semua label di bajunya dipotong, sebelum dia hilang?",
      "bytes": 72350,
      "seconds": 4.458,
      "sha256": "9031987c1b777d07fc9026136441b5503b0ceaf424f19dacf1760905a0037625"
    },
    {
      "file": "01_tanya.mp3",
      "text": "Kalau kamu punya delapan nama, yang mana yang kamu pakai pulang?",
      "bytes": 64408,
      "seconds": 3.947,
      "sha256": "cee7bfc794dc02cbc3e0cf85f5a5a2ed5850af1faf0d1f1e7a12169c48adbf0b"
    },
    {
      "file": "02_relate.mp3",
      "text": "Kita sembunyikan nama di internet. Dia pakai gunting.",
      "bytes": 55213,
      "seconds": 3.39,
      "sha256": "0dcd8142b1ad863e2dcde59cbb3f658e5af1dfdf2a389021336f700e68822b45"
    },
    {
      "file": "03_setup.mp3",
      "text": "November 1970, lembah Isdalen, Norwegia. Ada perempuan terbakar di atas batu.",
      "bytes": 102861,
      "seconds": 6.362,
      "sha256": "9a4317f7fda1185ef10295d0783c24ca58110d9e833badeca5bc95c5ccccafea"
    },
    {
      "file": "04_tension.mp3",
      "text": "Tubuhnya hangus dari depan. Punggungnya utuh.",
      "bytes": 50198,
      "seconds": 3.065,
      "sha256": "c3b97927e8d4c5e13b54c44d4ca461df4d9ab3386d466dba522afe66ea8436a6"
    },
    {
      "file": "05_tension.mp3",
      "text": "Ada jelaga di paru-parunya. Dia masih hidup waktu api menyala.",
      "bytes": 71514,
      "seconds": 4.412,
      "sha256": "22d4fb0147c046f1c7ba9d29d8e242f408441fa3224b14d6558d25ad26688ea6"
    },
    {
      "file": "06_tension.mp3",
      "text": "Lihat botolnya. Tandanya dikerok semua.",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "seconds": 2.972,
      "sha256": "6cf80dc7df3d2f904d732e359cf2b345a5ff44e9ee8a1cdc2e4cec1212e0bfc0"
    },
    {
      "file": "07_turn.mp3",
      "text": "Polisi bilang bunuh diri. Tapi orang mau mati nggak potong label.",
      "bytes": 68588,
      "seconds": 4.226,
      "sha256": "2ef31f50d913577a2d93363ed6ca1cc8224da2d70566ffdf49eb06c13cf4833a"
    },
    {
      "file": "08_consequence.mp3",
      "text": "Coba lihat kopernya di stasiun: wig, peta, uang asing.",
      "bytes": 73185,
      "seconds": 4.505,
      "sha256": "49fa530a9a7837c82f8c9234cada0878421c1bb82b02480a193b2fcff9a032cd"
    },
    {
      "file": "09_consequence.mp3",
      "text": "Empat puluh enam tahun kemudian, giginya bilang: Jerman.",
      "bytes": 71096,
      "seconds": 4.365,
      "sha256": "f12e9450be80f8ff82ea12293446cf377aa6234b3c7000400157630e3004c4cb"
    },
    {
      "file": "10_consequence.mp3",
      "text": "Namanya nggak pernah ada. Yang hilang cuma label.",
      "bytes": 53123,
      "seconds": 3.251,
      "sha256": "c6f959456747fc78ed3719649a38c6d2ca94ebe97edadab71b69a089a7dbb622"
    },
    {
      "file": "99_loop.mp3",
      "text": "Semua label hilang. Kamu nggak akan pernah tahu namanya.",
      "bytes": 69424,
      "seconds": 4.272,
      "sha256": "6df8608e25b1f9d797df9c0411622e3a83d8e1060c003218585106705c0770e8"
    },
